; Registros A de talent.itsgreener.com a ANADIR a la zona de Cloudflare (17 nov 2026, decision de Greener).
; Salen de la zona propia de talent en Dinahosting (captura del panel). Nombres cualificados. Importar con 'Proxy imported DNS records' desmarcado.
$ORIGIN itsgreener.com.
$TTL 300
talent	300	IN	A	82.98.169.92	; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
autoconfig.talent	300	IN	A	82.98.145.51	; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
autodiscover.talent	300	IN	A	82.98.145.60	; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
ftp.talent	300	IN	A	82.98.169.92	; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
mail.talent	300	IN	A	82.98.169.92	; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
mysql.talent	300	IN	A	82.98.169.92	; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
www.talent	300	IN	A	82.98.169.92	; cf_tags=cf-proxied:false
